@TaskTracker.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health check
GET {{TaskTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/

### List tasks
GET {{TaskTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks

### Create a task
POST {{TaskTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Review API proposal",
  "description": "Check requirements and estimate the work"
}

### Get a task by ID
GET {{TaskTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1

### Update a task
PUT {{TaskTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Review API proposal",
  "description": "Requirements checked",
  "isComplete": true
}

### Delete a task
DELETE {{TaskTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
